Modules
    - File Organizer - Made to monitor ../User/%username%/Downloads & ../User/$username%/Documents but will add function to include any folder
        --Can make sorted folder files in the directory or move files to another directory.
        --Folders to include/sort    
            ---Text
            ---Code
            ---Images
            ---Video
            ---Audio
            ---EXE/MSI
    - IP/Port Scanner
    - Super Logger : Get and combine windows events and error logs into a comprehensive summary with raw log viewer. Error Code translation
    - File Renamer
        --Make custom rename schemes for LOFT
            --- Testing prefix, suffix
    - Jitterbug : A visual representation of inturupts/studders you system experiences. 
    - Bottlenek : A performance test to tell if your system has any substantail bottlenecks. 